#: ../../source/encodeurl_README.md:1
msgid "Encode URL"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/encodeurl_README.md:3 ../../source/encodeurl_README.md:19
msgid ""
"Encode a URL to a percent-encoded form, excluding already-encoded "
"sequences."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/encodeurl_README.md:5
msgid "Installation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/encodeurl_README.md:11
msgid "API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/encodeurl_README.md:17
msgid "encodeUrl(url)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/encodeurl_README.md:21
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This function accepts a URL and encodes all the non-URL code points (as "
"UTF-8 byte sequences). It will not encode the \"%\" character unless it "
"is not part of a valid sequence (`%20` will be left as-is, but `%foo` "
"will be encoded as `%25foo`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/encodeurl_README.md:23
msgid ""
"This encode is meant to be \"safe\" and does not throw errors. It will "
"try as hard as it can to properly encode the given URL, including "
"replacing any raw, unpaired surrogate pairs with the Unicode replacement "
"character prior to encoding."
msgstr ""

